exports[`CLI help interface for 'config-manager delete' should be expected english 1`] = `
"Usage: frodo config-manager delete [options] [command]

[Experimental] Delete configuration optimized for CI/CD pipelines (format
compatible with fr-config-manager).

Options:
  -h, --help        Help
  -hh, --help-more  Help with all options.
  -hhh, --help-all  Help with all options, environment variables, and usage
                    examples.

Runtime Options:
  --no-prompt       Never prompt interactively (same as setting
                    FRODO_NO_PROMPT).

Commands:
  applications      [Experimental] Delete applications together with the objects
                    they own.
  custom-nodes      [Experimental] Delete custom nodes.
  email-templates   [Experimental] Delete email template objects.
  endpoints         [Experimental] Delete custom endpoint objects.
  scripts           [Experimental] Delete AM scripts. Default scripts are never
                    deleted.
  secrets           [Experimental] [Cloud-only] Delete secrets.
  test              [Experimental] Test connection and authentication.
  themes            [Experimental] Delete themes by name or delete all themes in
                    the selected realms.

Utilities:
  help              display help for command


Run without a sub-command to enter interactive mode."
`;
